.DS_Store
**/.vscode/
**/__pycache__/

**/build/
**/managed_components/

**/sdkconfig
**/sdkconfig.old

*.bin
*.elf
*.map

# Real Thread Active Dataset material (contains the Network Key) -- see
# docs/otbr-rcp.md / docs/power-base.md's EXTERNAL_OTBR section. Never
# commit a real dataset hex file or a generated *_otbr_config.bin image.
/secrets/
**/otbr-active-dataset.hex

# Matter bridge (docs/matter-bridge.md): build-time-only artifacts.
# //third_party/connectedhomeip is a symlink tools/build_matter_bridge.sh
# creates fresh every run, pointed at the CHIP_ROOT of whoever is
# building -- never checked in (CHIP_ROOT varies per machine, and this
# repo must never vendor the SDK). pogo-matter-bridge.zap is generated
# from pogo-matter-bridge.zap.in (which IS checked in) the same way, for
# the same reason (its package paths must point at that same CHIP_ROOT).
/linux/matter_bridge/app/third_party/connectedhomeip
/linux/matter_bridge/app/bridge-common/pogo-matter-bridge.zap
/linux/matter_bridge/app/out/
EOF
